        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Avarage technique for European Union. The infrastructure was assumed to be the same as for rolling steel.\n\n# Included processes\nAll the process steps, which can be attributed to semi-fabrication (sawing, scalping, hot rolling, cold rolling, solution heat treatment, finishing and packaging), are included. Does not include the material beeing rolled, only the amount of scrap lost in waste is balanced as primary aluminium input. Includes the transport of the materials to the plant, but does not include the transport of the product to the customer.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
